***** PLL 0 *****

Instance Name                 : CMOSPLL
Resource                      : PLL_BR1
Locked Pin Name               : CMOSPLL_LOCKED
Reference Clock Mode          : core
Reference Clock               : sysclk
Feedback Mode                 : internal

Reference Clock Frequency     : 50.00 MHz
Reference Clock Period        : 20.00 ns
Multiplier (M)                : 27
Pre-Divider (N)               : 1
VCO Frequency                 : 1350.00 MHz
Post-Divider (O)              : 2
PLL Frequency                 : 675.00 MHz

Output Clock 0
Clock Pin Name                : CMOSPLL_CMOSCLKOUT
Output Divider                : 25
Output Phase Shift            : 0
Output Frequency              : 27.00 MHz
Output Period                 : 37.04 ns

Frequency calculations:
	VCO = REFCLK * (M/N)
	    = 50.00 MHz * (27/1)
	    = 1350.00 MHz
	PLL = VCO / O
	    = 1350.00 MHz / 2
	    = 675.00 MHz

	CLKOUT0 = PLL / CLKOUT0_DIV
	        = 675.00 MHz / 25
	        = 27.00 MHz

SDC Constraints:
	create_clock -period 37.04 CMOSPLL_CMOSCLKOUT

